Z||000004||pherder||06-19-2000||09:10 PM||||The place I have been taking my stuff to is kind of screwy on their pricing.<P>I took the four rear non-adjustible links (88), four spindles (two each front & rear) and my IDI cover for my Quad 4.  They charged me right @ $100.<P>I then took the four front A (C?) arms in and they charged me $90.<P>Either I made out like a bandit on the first set or got scr*w*d on the second set.<P>This is in Wichita, KS.  When I had the engine cradle done in Dallas, TX, it cost me $150 to have it gloss black coated.<P>Paul||||reg||5
